    "caption": "🚀 Show the world what your startup is made of — at London Tech Week 2025!\n\nWe’re selecting 4 startups to represent Kazakhstan at one of the biggest tech events in Europe — London Tech Week, happening June 9–11 at Olympia London. Join over 45,000 participants from 90+ countries — including top startups, global corporations, VCs, and government leaders.\n\nWhat’s included?\n✅ A FREE startup booth to showcase your product\n✅ B2B networking with investors, tech giants & potential partners\n✅ Full access to 30,000+ attendees & 500+ speakers from across the globe\n\nWho can apply?\n🔹 You’re a resident of Astana Hub\n🔹 Your product is at PMF stage or beyond\n🔹 You speak English fluently\n🔹 Your product aligns with the key sectors of the forum\n\n✈️ Important: Travel, accommodation, and visa expenses must be covered by the startup. Participation costs are fully covered by Astana Hub (booth, pass, stand design).\n\n🗓 Event: June 9–11, 2025\n📬 Apply: April 22–30, 2025\n\n📢 Only 4 teams will be selected — apply via the link in bio → «Events» section. Don’t miss your shot to go global! 🌍",
